{"product_id":"fundamentals-of-structural-analysis-2nd-edition","title":"Fundamentals of Structural Analysis 2nd edition","description":"\u003cp\u003e*********Text Available as of 2\/13\/2004!**********  Fundamentals of Structural Analysis, second edition introduces engineering and architectural students to the basic techniques for analyzing the most common structural elements, including beams, trusses, frames, cables, and arches.  Leet and Uang cover the classical methods of analysis for determinate and indeterminate structures, and provide an introduction to the matrix formulation on which computer analysis is based.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 201 x 231\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kenneth Leet | Chia-Ming Uang\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780071238304\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803715035289,"sku":"ACA-29780071238304","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f3c0c01a653_0072973153.01.LZZZZZZZ.jpg?v=1760806320","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/fundamentals-of-structural-analysis-2nd-edition","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}